==Strategy==
Quite an easy stage provided you have gathered all relevant treasures from [[Empire of Cats]].

At the beginning, use the Sir Seals and Mooths for money, use [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] on the Sir Seals, and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] on the Mooths. Spawn [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] as soon as you can, since they'll be your main damage source against Wrestling.

It is important to note that Wrestling only has single target, meaning if you meatshield well enough, she'll never be able to hit your ranged attackers. Over time, you will accumulate a stack of legs, dragons, and any other ranged attackers you brought, meaning your damage supply will increase exponentially. Level 20 units should be all that's needed for this stage.

